Adventurer,

If you're looking for a great deal on vanity items, Gold, and Premium, now'=
s your chance: for a limited time, *Starter Bundles* are available to *all =
players* in the in-game store! These bundles offer a combination of *vanity=
 items, Gold, and Premium* at a huge discount, and are normally only availa=
ble to players who have never bought Premium on an underlying character. Bu=
t from now until *February 28 at 10:00 UTC* , this offer is available in-ga=
me to *all players*.

The available Bundles are:

* *Paladin Set + 360 Days Premium + 2000 Gold*
* *Barbarian Set + 180 Days Premium + 1000 Gold*
* *Keeper of Souls Set + 90 Days Premium + 500 Gold*
* *Hell Mare Skin + 30 Days Premium + 150 Gold*

( https://albiononline.com/news/starter-bundles )

To purchase one or more of these bundles, just log in on the native client,=
 Steam client, or Google Play and click the "Starter Bundles" tab in the in=
-game store. Any bundle with a skin not yet unlocked on your account will b=
e available.

This offer will only be open to all players until *February 28* , so take a=
dvantage of it today!

( https://albiononline.com/news/starter-bundles )

